{"code":0,"data":{"title":"攻略站素材设计规范","content":"<table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>素材名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>规范</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>例图</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>tab图标</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>宽度最大350PX，高度固定60PX，50k以内，png格式</p><p>点击前和点击后图标两张，点击前置灰，点击后做彩色</p><p>点击前按钮可输出gif动图</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/9ttgkl/20260127142024753594.png\" data-natural-width=\"211\" data-natural-height=\"54\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/zwdrul/20260127142037027135.png\" data-natural-width=\"208\" data-natural-height=\"53\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>背景图</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1080*1600，支持jpeg,png,jpg格式，500kb以内</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/xvzxqRY9</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/s2dhtk/20260127152142277862.png\" data-natural-width=\"246\" data-natural-height=\"365\" data-type=\"image\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>金刚位</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>108*108，300k以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式图标表意需与金刚位名称表达一致，尽量贴合游戏风格</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/tpzMmZjA</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/feucqg/20260127152416400353.png\" width=\"494\" height=\"148\" data-natural-width=\"1107\" data-natural-height=\"331\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>签到金刚位背景图</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>背景：手机端:984*240px；折叠屏:1818*240px。300kb以内，支持jpeg,png,jpg格式</p><p>签到按钮：尺寸：162*81px,无字，50kb以内，支持png格式</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/xvzxqRY9</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/7fivi6/20260127152221726233.png\" data-natural-width=\"506\" data-natural-height=\"144\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>桌面组件金刚位</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>60*60，300k以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式</p><p>图片表意需与金刚位名称表达一致</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/LEYzhK0L</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/we55bh/20260127152319137108.png\" data-natural-width=\"393\" data-natural-height=\"274\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>轮播banner</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1080*380，150k以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/FxWc3sim</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/np9tof/20260127152333318622.png\" data-natural-width=\"499\" data-natural-height=\"185\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>胶囊banner</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1080*240，500k以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式边框需做异形设计，无标准规范，可参照例图，不超出尺寸即可</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/tsjQwgli</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/yu8rlx/20260127152347386875.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"112\" data-natural-width=\"1080\" data-natural-height=\"240\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>穿插banner</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1080*380，150k以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/kM8N5M1x</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/7lnljr/20260127152443985044.png\" data-natural-width=\"494\" data-natural-height=\"174\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>双列banner</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>474*244，500K以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/8uoUamh4</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/tb92ho/20260127152459978721.png\" data-natural-width=\"506\" data-natural-height=\"156\" data-type=\"image\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>右滑竖图</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>480*552，150K以内，支持 jpeg，png，jpg，gif 格式</p><p>图片中的元素要与内容相关，且图片上不可有文字&nbsp;（注：示例图上的文字为后台配置生成）</p><p>设计规范：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://share.weiyun.com/axKjTibZ\">https://share.weiyun.com/7HEDBQzj</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260127/1yrops/20260127152518213718.png\" data-natural-width=\"400\" data-natural-height=\"218\" data-type=\"image\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table>","versionCode":2,"updateTime":1769498724000,"breadCrumbs":"游戏管理,游戏圈运营管理说明,攻略站素材设计规范","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}